<title>USA: San Angelo ISD, Texas $12 mln Zions Bank.</title>
<headline>San Angelo ISD, Texas $12 mln Zions Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bank said it won $12 million of San Angelo ISD, Texas, variable rate bonds, Series 1997, with a lowest rate of 3.90 percent.</p>
</text>
